1000130,"42 2C F4",1,"U",130,"1U130",0,"No Ordinary Storm",,"Isengard","Condition",,"Support Area",1,,,,,,,,"Fellowship Block","Isengard_Verb","01_130",,,,,,,"<br>Each time you play a weather condition, exert a <symbol>gandalf</symbol> companion or <symbol>gandalf</symbol> ally.","��So Gandalf... you try to lead them over Caradhras. And if that fails � where then will you go?'�","Kein gew�hnlicher Sturm",,"Spiele diese Karte in deinen Unterst�tzungs-bereich. Jedesmal, wenn du einen Wettereffekt spielst, strenge einen <symbol>gandalf</symbol> Gef�hrten oder einen <symbol>gandalf</symbol> Verb�ndeten an.","""Nun Gandalf, du versuchst sie �ber den Caradhras zu f�hren. Und wenn das fehlschl�gt, welchen Weg w�hlt ihr dann?�","Pas une Temp�te Ordinaire",,"Chaque fois que vous jouez une situation de climat, affaiblissez un compagnon <symbol>gandalf</symbol> ou un alli� <symbol>gandalf</symbol>.","��Alors Gandalf ... vous essayez de les mener au-del� du Caradhras. Et si cela �choue � o� irez-vous alors ?'�","Una Tempesta Straordinaria",,"Ogni volta che giochi una condizione Atmosferica, sforza un compagno <symbol>gandalf</symbol> o alleato <symbol>gandalf</symbol>.","��Cos� Gandalf... tu provi a condurli oltre il Caradhras. E se dovessi fallire � poi dove andrai?'�","No Era una Tormenta Ordinaria",,"Cada vez que juegas una condici�n de clima, esfuerza un compa�ero <symbol>gandalf</symbol> o un aliado <symbol>gandalf</symbol>.","�As� pues Gandalf... Intentas guiarlos a trav�s del Caradhras. Y s� eso falla � �a donde iras?�"
