1000301,"4D 36 F4",1,"U",301,"1U301",1,"Master Proudfoot","Distant Relative of Bilbo","Shire","Ally","Hobbit",,1,2,2,,,"1",,,"Fellowship Block","Shire_Noun","01_301","icon_strength","2","icon_vitality","2",,,"<keyword>Fellowship:</keyword> If the twilight pool has fewer than 3 twilight tokens, add <symbol>twilight2</symbol> to reveal the top 3 cards of your draw deck.  Take all <symbol>shire</symbol> cards revealed into hand and discard the rest.","�His name, of course, was Proudfoot, and well merited; his feet were large, exceptionally furry....�","Meister Stolzfu�","Verwandter von Bilbo","<keyword>Gemeinschaft.</keyword> Wenn der Einfluss weniger als 3 betr�gt, erh�he ihn um <symbol>twilight2</symbol>, um die 3 obersten Karten deines Spieldecks aufzudecken. Nimm alle aufgedeckte <symbol>shire</symbol> Karten in deine Hand und lege die �brigen ab.","Sein Name war nat�rlich Stolzfu� und wohlverdient; seine F�sse waren gro� und aussergew�hnlich pelzig...","Ma�tre Fierpied","Parent �loign� de Bilbon","<keyword>Compagnie :</keyword> Si la r�serve cr�pusculaire a moins de 3 jetons-cr�puscule, ajoutez <symbol>twilight2</symbol> pour r�v�ler les 3 premi�res cartes de votre pioche. Prenez en main toutes les cartes <symbol>shire</symbol> r�v�l�es et d�faussez les autres.","�Il s'appelait Fierpied, bien entendu, et il m�ritait bien son nom: ses pieds �taient grands, exceptionnellement velus....�","Signor Tronfipiede","Parente alla Lontana di Bilbo","<keyword>Compagnia:</keyword> Se la zona del crepuscolo ha meno di 3 segnalini crepuscolo, aggiungi <symbol>twilight2</symbol> per mostrare le prime 3 carte del tuo mazzo di gioco. Aggiungi alla mano tutte le carte <symbol>shire</symbol> mostrate e scarta il resto.","�Il suo cognome era beninteso Tronfipiede, e a buon diritto: i suoi piedi erano enormi, straordinariamente pelosi...�","Maestro Ganapi�","Familiar Distante de Bilbo","<keyword>Comunidad:</keyword> Si el Fondo de Penumbra tiene menos de 3 contadores de penumbra, a�ade