1000364,"4C 3A F4",1,"P",364,"1P364",1,"Gandalf","The Grey Wizard","Gandalf","Companion","Wizard",,4,7,4,,,,,,"Fellowship Block","Gandalf_Noun","01_364","icon_strength","7","icon_vitality","4","Signet_Gandalf",,"<keyword>Fellowship:</keyword> Exert Gandalf to play a companion who has the Gandalf signet. The twilight cost of that companion is -2.","�...his long white hair, his sweeping silver beard, and his broad shoulders, made him look like some wise king of ancient legend.�","Gandalf","Der Graue","<keyword>Gemeinschaft.</keyword> Strenge Gandalf an, um einen Gef�hrten mit dem Gandalf Siegel auszuspielen. Die Zwielichtkosten dieses Gef�hrten reduzieren sich um 2.","...aber sein langes weisses Haar, sein wallender Silberbart und seine breiten Schultern liessen ihn wie einen weisen K�nig aus einer alten Sage erscheinen.","Gandalf","Le Magicien Gris","<keyword>Compagnie :</keyword> Affaiblissez Gandalf pour jouer un compagnon qui a le sceau Gandalf. Le co�t cr�pusculaire de ce compagnon est de -2.","�...ses longs cheveux blancs, son abondante barbe grise et ses larges �paules lui donnaient l'air de quelque roi sage des l�gendes anciennes.�","Gandalf","Lo Stregone Grigio","<keyword>Compagnia:</keyword> Sforza Gandalf per giocare un compagno che abbia il sigillo di Gandalf. Sottrai -2 al costa crepuscolo di quel compagno.","""...ina la lunga chioma bianca, la folta barba d'argento e le spalle possenti facevano pensare a qualche saggio re delle leggende.""","Gandalf","El Mago Gris","<keyword>Comunidad:</keyword> Esfuerza a Gandalf para jugar un compa�ero que tenga el sello de Gandalf. El coste de penumbra de ese compa�ero es -2.","�...la larga melena blanca, la abundante barba gris, y los anchos hombros, le daban un aspecto de rey sabio, salido de antiguas leyendas.�"
