3000055,"67 6F DC 02",3,"C",55,"3C55",0,"Isengard Axe",,"Isengard","Possession",,"Hand Weapon",0,,,,,,,,"Fellowship Block","Isengard_Verb","03_055","icon_strength","+2",,,,,"Bearer must be an <symbol>isengard</symbol> Orc.  <br>When you play this weapon, add <symbol>twilight1</symbol>. ","Axes eat into the forests of Isengard as well as the victims of Saruman's Orcs.","Isengart Axt",,"Muss auf einen <symbol>isengard</symbol> Ork gespielt werden. Erh�he den Einfluss um <symbol>twilight1</symbol>, wenn du diese Waffe spielst.","Die �xte fra�en sich sowohl in die B�ume Isengarts als auch in die Opfer von Sarumans Orks.","Hache de l'Isengard",,"Le d�tenteur doit �tre un Orque <symbol>isengard</symbol>. Quand vous jouez cette arme, ajoutez <symbol>twilight1</symbol>.","Les haches s'enfoncent aussi bien dans les for�ts de l'Isengard que dans les victimes des Orques de Saroumane.","Ascia di Isengard",,"Il possessore deve essere un Orco <symbol>isengard</symbol>. Quando giochi quest�arma, aggiungi <symbol>twilight1</symbol>.","Le loro asce penetrano nelle foreste di Isengard come nelle vittime degli Orchi di Saruman.","Hacha de Isengard",,"El portador debe ser un Orco <symbol>isengard</symbol>. Cuando juegas este arma, a�ade <symbol>twilight1</symbol>.","Sus hachas no solo se alimentan en los bosques de Isengard, sino tambi�n en la carne de sus victimas."
3000056,"68 6F DC 02",3,"C",56,"3C56",0,"Isengard Forger",,"Isengard","Minion","Orc",,2,6,2,,4,,,,"Fellowship Block","Isengard_Noun","03_056","icon_strength","6","icon_vitality","2","Icon_Compass",,"<keyword>Shadow:</keyword> Exert this minion to add <symbol>twilight1</symbol>.  ","��I looked on it and saw that, whereas it had once been green and fair, it was now filled with pits and forges.'�","Isengart Schmied",,"<keyword>Schatten:</keyword> Strenge diesen Diener an, um den Einfluss um <symbol>twilight1</symbol> zu erh�hen.","""Ich schaute hinunter und sah, dass es, w�hrend es fr�her gr�n und sch�n gewesen war, jetzt voller Gruben und Schmieden war.�","Forgeur de l'Isengard",,"Ombre : Affaiblissez ce s�ide pour ajouter <symbol>twilight1</symbol>.","� �La contemplant, je vis qu'alors qu'autrefois elle �tait verte et belle, elle �tait � pr�sent remplie de puits et de forges.� �","Forgiatore di Isengard",,"<keyword>Ombra:</keyword> Sforza questo servitore per aggiungere <symbol>twilight1</symbol>.","��In passato era verde e bella, ma ora guardando vidi che era piena di pozzi e di fucine.'�","Forjador de Isengard",,"<keyword>Sombra:</keyword> Esfuerza este siervo para a�adir <symbol>twilight1</symbol>.","�Mir� en �l y vi eso, donde antes era verde y hermoso, ahora estaba lleno de pozos y forjas.�"
3000057,"69 6F DC 02",3,"U",57,"3U57",0,"Isengard Retainer",,"Isengard","Minion","Orc",,4,8,3,,4,,,,"Fellowship Block","Isengard_Noun","03_057","icon_strength","8","icon_vitality","3","Icon_Compass",,"<keyword>Regroup:</keyword> Exert this minion to make the Free Peoples player wound a companion. ","��...the Eagles of the mountain went far and wide, and they saw many things: the gathering of wolves and the mustering of Orcs....'�","Isengart Gefolgsmann",,"<keyword>Sammeln:</keyword> Strenge diesen Diener an, um den Freie V�lker Spieler zu zwingen, einen Gef�hrten zu verwunden.","""Und die Adler des Gebirges flogen �berallhin und sahen viele Dinge: das Sammeln der W�lfe und die Anwerbung der Orks....�","Vassal de l'Isengard",,"<keyword>Ralliement :</keyword> Affaiblissez ce s�ide pour obliger le joueur des Peuples Libres � blesser un compagnon.","� �...les Aigles des Montagnes all�rent de tous c�t�s et virent bien des choses: le rassemblement des loups et le rappel des orques...� �","Seguace di Isengard",,"<keyword>Raccolta:</keyword> Sforza questo servitore per far ferire al giocatore dei Popoli Liberi un compagno.","��...le Aquile delle Montagne volarono in lungo e in largo, e videro molte cose: il riunirsi dei lupi e il radunarsi degli Orchi...'�","Criado de Isengard",,"<keyword>Reagrupaci�n:</keyword> Esfuerza este siervo para hacer que el jugador de Gentes Libres hiera un compa�ero.","�... Las �guilas de la monta�a fueron a lo largo y a lo ancho, y vieron muchas cosas: la agrupaci�n de los lobos y la asamblea de los Orcos...�"
3000058,"6A 6F DC 02",3,"U",58,"3U58",0,"Isengard Servant",,"Isengard","Minion","Orc",,3,7,3,,4,,,,"Fellowship Block","Isengard_Noun","03_058","icon_strength","7","icon_vitality","3","Icon_Compass",,"<keyword>Regroup:</keyword> Exert this minion to make the Free Peoples player wound a companion. ","The servants of Isengard worked tirelessly to spread the influence of their master.","Isengart Sklave",,"<keyword>Sammeln:</keyword> Strenge diesen Diener an, um den Freie V�lker Spieler zu zwingen, einen Gef�hrten zu verwunden.","Die Sklaven Isengarts schufteten unerm�dlich, um den Einfluss ihres Meisters zu vergr��ern.","Serviteur de l'Isengard",,"<keyword>Ralliement :</keyword> Affaiblissez ce s�ide pour obliger le joueur des Peuples Libres � blesser un compagnon.","Les serviteurs de l'Isengard travaillaient sans r�pit pour �tendre l'influence de leur ma�tre.","Servo di Isengard",,"<keyword>Raccolta:</keyword> Sforza questo servitore per far ferire al giocatore dei Popoli Liberi un compagno.","I servitori di Isengard lavoravano senza fermarsi per diffondere l'influenza del loro signore.","Servidor de Isengard",,"<keyword>Reagrupaci�n:</keyword> Esfuerza este siervo para hacer que el jugador de Gentes Libres hiera un compa�ero.","Los servidores de Isengard trabajaron sin descanso para expandir el poder de su amo."
3000059,"6B 6F DC 02",3,"C",59,"3C59",0,"Isengard Shaman",,"Isengard","Minion","Orc",,1,5,2,,4,,,,"Fellowship Block","Isengard_Noun","03_059","icon_strength","5","icon_vitality","2","Icon_Compass",,"<keyword>Response:</keyword> If an <symbol>isengard</symbol> Orc is about to take a wound, remove <symbol>twilight2</symbol> to prevent that wound. ","��Over all his works a dark smoke hung and wrapped itself about the sides of Orthanc.'�","Isengart Schamane",,"<keyword>Reaktion:</keyword> Wenn ein <symbol>isengard</symbol> Ork verwundet wird, verringere den Einfluss um <symbol>twilight2</symbol>, um diese Wunde zu verhindern.","""�ber seinen ganzen Werkst�tten lagerte ein dichter Rauch und h�llte sogar die Flanken des Orthanc ein.�","Chaman de l'Isengard",,"<keyword>R�ponse :</keyword> Si un Orque <symbol>isengard</symbol> est sur le point d��tre bless�, retirez <symbol>twilight2</symbol> pour pr�venir la blessure.","� �Sur tous ses ouvrages �tait suspendue une fum�e sombre qui enveloppait les flancs de l'Orthanc.� �","Sciamano di Isengard",,"<keyword>Risposta:</keyword> Se un Orco <symbol>isengard</symbol> sta per subire una ferita, rimuovi <symbol>twilight2</symbol> per prevenire quella ferita.","��Un fumo scuro stagnava in basso e si avvolgeva intorno ai fianchi di Orthanc.'�","Cham�n de Isengard",,"<keyword>Respuesta:</keyword> Si un Orco <symbol>isengard</symbol> va a recibir una herida, quita <symbol>twilight2</symbol> para prevenir esa herida.","�Sobre todas aquellas fraguas flotaba un humo oscuro que se apretaba contra los flancos de Orthanc.�"
