4000003,"63 90 D0 03",4,"C",3,"4C3",0,"Anger",,"Dunland","Event",,"Skirmish",0,,,,,,,,"Tower Block","Dunland_Verb","04_003",,,,,,,"<keyword>Skirmish:</keyword> Spot 3 <symbol>dunland</symbol> minions or a site you control to make a <symbol>dunland</symbol> Man <keyword>fierce</keyword> until the regroup phase. ","Rage filled the hearts of the Dunlending attackers.","Zorn",,"<keyword>Kampf</keyword> Entdecke 3 <symbol>dunland</symbol> Diener oder einen Ort, den du kontrollierst, um einen <symbol>dunland</symbol> Menschen bis zur Sammelphase <keyword>Erbittert</keyword> zu machen.","Rasender Zorn erf�llte die Herzen der Angreifer aus dem Dunland.","Col�re",,"<keyword>Combat :</keyword> D�signez 3 s�ides <symbol>dunland</symbol> ou un site que vous contr�lez pour rendre un Homme <symbol>dunland</symbol> <keyword>acharn�</keyword> jusqu�� la phase de ralliement.","La rage emplissait le coeur des attaquants de Dun.","Collera",,"<keyword>Schermaglia:</keyword> Avvista 3 servitori <symbol>dunland</symbol> o un sito che controlli per rendere <keyword>Feroce</keyword> un Uomo <symbol>dunland</symbol> fino alla fase di raccolta.","La rabbia riemp� i cuori degli assalitori Dunlandiani.","Rabia",,"<keyword>Escaramuza:</keyword> Avista 3 siervos <symbol>dunland</symbol> o un sitio que controles para dar a un Hombre <symbol>dunland</symbol> <keyword>fiero</keyword> hasta la fase de reagrupaci�n.","La furia llen� los corazones de los atacantes Dunlendinos."
4000004,"64 90 D0 03",4,"C",4,"4C4",0,"Band of Wild Men",,"Dunland","Minion","Man",,5,11,2,,3,,,,"Tower Block","Dunland_Noun","04_004","icon_strength","11","icon_vitality","2","Icon_Compass",,"Each time this minion wins a skirmish, you may make it <keyword>fierce</keyword> until the regroup phase. ","��The Wild Men of Dunland have no love for Th�oden of Rohan since he took their land.'�","Horde wilder Menschen",,"Jedes Mal, wenn dieser Diener einen Kampf gewinnt, darfst du ihn bis zur Sammelphase <keyword>Erbittert</keyword> machen.","�Diese Wilden aus Dunland hassen Th�oden daf�r, dass er ihnen ihr Land genommen hat.�","Bande d'Hommes Sauvages",,"Chaque fois que ce s�ide remporte un combat, vous pouvez le rendre <keyword>acharn�</keyword> jusqu�� la phase de ralliement.","� �Les Hommes sauvages du Pays de Dun n'ont aucune d�votion pour Th�oden de Rohan depuis qu'il leur a pris leurs terres.� �","Banda di Uomini Selvaggi",,"Ogni volta che questo servitore vince una schermaglia, puoi renderlo <keyword>Feroce</keyword> fino alla fase di raccolta.","��Gli Uomini selvaggi del Dunland odiano Th�oden di Rohan da quando egli ha preso le loro terre.'�","Banda De Hombres Salvajes",,"Cada vez que este siervo gana una escaramuza, puedes darle <keyword>fiero</keyword> hasta la fase de reagrupaci�n.","�Los hombres salvajes de las Tierras Pardas no le tienen aprecio a Th�oden de Rohan desde que tom� sus tierras.�"
