4000006,"66 90 D0 03",4,"R",6,"4R6",0,"Constantly Threatening",,"Dunland","Condition",,"Support Area",1,,,,,,,,"Tower Block","Dunland_Verb","04_006",,,,,,,"<br><keyword>Shadow:</keyword> If the fellowship has moved more than once this turn, remove <symbol>twilight2</symbol> to play a <symbol>dunland</symbol> Man from your discard pile. ","The men of Dunland have hated the Rohirrim for many years.","Anhaltende Bedrohung",,"Spiele diese Karte in deinen Unterst�tzungs-bereich. <keyword>Schatten:</keyword> Verringere den Einfluss um <symbol>twilight2</symbol>, wenn sich die Gemeinschaft in diesem Spielzug mehr als einmal bewegt hat, um einen <symbol>dunland</symbol> Menschen aus deinem Ablagestapel zu spielen.","Die Menschen aus Dunland hassten die Rohirrim schon seit vielen Jahren.","Une Menace Constante",,"Ombre : Si la compagnie s�est d�plac�e plus d�une fois pendant ce tour, retirez <symbol>twilight2</symbol> pour jouer un Homme <symbol>dunland</symbol> de votre pile de d�fausse.","La haine de Ceux du Pays de Dun pour les Rohirrim perdure depuis longtemps.","Minaccia Costante",,"<keyword>Ombra:</keyword> Se la compagnia si � mossa pi� di una volta in questo turno, rimuovi <symbol>twilight2</symbol> per giocare un Uomo <symbol>dunland</symbol> dalla tua pila degli scarti.","Gli uomini del Dunland hanno in odio i Rohirrim da molti anni.","Amenazando Constantemente",,"<keyword>Sombra:</keyword> Si la comunidad se ha movido m�s de una vez este turno, quita <symbol>twilight2</symbol> para jugar un Hombre <symbol>dunland</symbol> de tu pila de descartes.","Los hombres de las Tierras Pardas han odiado a los Rohirrim por largos a�os."
4000007,"67 90 D0 03",4,"C",7,"4C7",0,"Dark Fury",,"Dunland","Event",,"Skirmish",0,,,,,,,,"Tower Block","Dunland_Verb","04_007",,,,,,,"<keyword>Skirmish:</keyword> Make a <symbol>dunland</symbol> Man strength +2 (or +4 if at a sanctuary). ","�Dunland and Dunlendings are the names that the Rohirrim gave to them, because they were swarthy and dark-haired....�","Dunkle Wut",,"<keyword>Kampf</keyword> Gib einem <symbol>dunland</symbol> Menschen St�rke +2 (oder St�rke +4, wenn er sich an einer Zuflucht befindet).","Dunland und Dunl�nder sind die Namen, die die Rohirrim ihnen gaben, weil sie schw�rzlich und dunkelhaarig waren.","Fureur Noire",,"<keyword>Combat :</keyword> Donnez +2 en force � un Homme <symbol>dunland</symbol> (ou +4 s�il est � un sanctuaire).","� Les Rohirrim, eux, les appelaient gens du Pays de Dun, ou Ceux du Pays de Dun parce qu'ils avaient le teint basan� et le cheveu noir... �","Furia Oscura",,"<keyword>Schermaglia:</keyword> Aggiungi +2 alla forza di un Uomo <symbol>dunland</symbol> (o +4 se � presso un rifugio).","�Dunland e Dunlandiani erano i nomi dati loro dai Rohirrim, perch� erano scuri di pelle e di capelli...�","Furia Oscura",,"<keyword>Escaramuza:</keyword> Da a un Hombre <symbol>dunland</symbol> fuerza +2 (o +4 si est� en un santuario).","�Dunlendinos de las Tierras Pardas fue el nombre que los Rohirrim les dieron, porque eran de cabellos negros y rostros cetrinos...�"
