4000117,"65 97 D0 03",4,"C",117,"4C117",1,"Faramir","Son of Denethor","Gondor","Companion","Man",,3,7,3,,,,,,"Tower Block","Gondor_Noun","04_117","icon_strength","7","icon_vitality","3","Signet_Frodo",,"<keyword>Ring-bound. Ranger.</keyword><br>An opponent may not play skirmish events or use skirmish special abilities during skirmishes involving Faramir. ","�He could see Faramir's face, which was now unmasked; it was stern and commanding, and a keen wit lay behind his searching glance.�","Faramir","Sohn des Denethor","<keyword>Ring-verbunden.</keyword> <keyword>Waldl�ufer.</keyword><br>Deine Gegenspieler d�rfen in K�mpfen, an denen Faramir beteiligt ist, keine Kampfereignisse spielen oder spezielle Kampff�higkeiten benutzen.","Er sah Faramirs Gesicht, der jetzt keine Maske trug: es war streng und herrisch, und ein scharfer Verstand sprach aus seinem forschenden Blick.","Faramir","Fils de Denethor","<keyword>Associ� � l�Anneau.</keyword> <keyword>R�deur.</keyword><br>Un adversaire ne peut pas jouer d��v�nements de combat ou utiliser des capacit�s sp�ciales de combat pendant les combats qui impliquent Faramir.","� Il voyait le visage de Faramir, � pr�sent d�masqu�: il �tait s�v�re et imposant; une intelligence aigu� paraissait dans son regard scrutateur. �","Faramir","Figlio di Denethor","<keyword>Legato all�Anello.</keyword> <keyword>Ramingo.</keyword><br>Un avversario non pu� giocare eventi di schermaglia o usare abilit� speciali di schermaglia durante le schermaglie che coinvolgano Faramir.","�Vedeva il viso di Faramir, ora senza maschera: era severo ed imperioso, e dietro al suo sguardo investigatore si nascondeva un'intelligenza acuta.�","Faramir","Hijo de Denethor","<keyword>Vinculado al Anillo.</keyword> <keyword>Montaraz.</keyword> Un oponente no puede jugar eventos de escaramuza ni usar habilidades especiales de escaramuza durante escaramuzas en las que participe Faramir.","�Ve�a el rostro de Faramir, ahora desenmascarado: era severo e imperioso; y detr�s de 