4000237,"6D 9E D0 03",4,"R",237,"4R237",1,"Ithilien Wilderness",,"Raider","Condition",,"Support Area",0,,,,,,,,"Tower Block","Raider_Verb","04_237",,,,,,,"Plays to your support area.<br>At the start of each phase during which the fellowship has moved to 7<symbol>tower</symbol>, 8<symbol>tower</symbol>, or 9<symbol>tower</symbol> and the twilight pool has fewer than 7 twilight tokens, you may add <symbol>twilight8</symbol>.<br><keyword>Skirmish:</keyword> Discard this condition to make a <symbol>raider</symbol> Man strength +2.",,"Die Wildnis Ithiliens",,"Am Ende der Phase, in der sich die Gemeinschaft an Ort 7<symbol>tower</symbol>, 8<symbol>tower</symbol> oder 9<symbol>tower</symbol> befindet und der Einfluss weniger als 7 betr�gt, darfst du den Einfluss um <symbol>twilight8</symbol> erh�hen.<br>Kampf Lege diesen Effekt ab, um einem <symbol>raider</symbol> Menschen St�rke +2 zu geben.",,"La Nature de L'Ithilien",,"Jouable dans votre aire de soutien.<br>A la fin de chaque phase durant laquelle la compagnie s'est d�plac�e vers le sites 7<symbol>tower</symbol>, 8<symbol>tower</symbol> ou 9<symbol>tower</symbol>, et que la r�serve cr�pusculaire contient moins de 7 jetons-cr�puscule, vous pouvez ajouter <symbol>twilight8</symbol>.<br><keyword>Combat:</keyword> D�faussez cette situation pour donner +2 en force � un Homme <symbol>moria</symbol>.",,"Landa dell'Ithilien",,"Giocala nella tua area di supporto.<br>Alla fine di ogni fase in cui la compagnia si � mossa ai siti 7<symbol>tower</symbol>, 8<symbol>tower</symbol> o 9<symbol>tower</symbol> e la zona del crepuscolo ha meno di 7 segnalini, puoi aggiungere <symbol>twilight8</symbol>.<br>Schermaglia: Scarta questa condizione per aggiungere +2 alla forza di un Uomo <symbol>moria</symbol>.",,"Tierras Salvajes De Ithilien",,"Al principio de cada una de tus fases de Sombra, si la comunidad est� en el sitio 7<symbol>tower</symbol>, 8<symbol>tower</symbol>, o 9<symbol>tower</symbol> y el fondo de penumbra tiene menos de 7 conta