9000037,"65 46 95 08",9,"R",37,"9R37",1,"Seeing Stone of Minas Anor",,"Gondor","Artifact",,"Support Area",0,,,,,,,,"None","Gondor_Artifact","09_037",,,,,,,"To play, spot a <symbol>gondor</symbol> Man with 3 or more vitality (or spot a <symbol>gondor</symbol> Man and add 2 threats). <br><keyword>Regroup:</keyword> Exert a <symbol>gondor</symbol> Man or discard this artifact to discard your hand and draw 3 cards. ","��Didst thou think that the eyes of the White Tower were blind?'�","Der sehende Stein von Minas Anor",,"Entdecke einen <symbol>gondor</symbol> Menschen, um diese Karte zu spielen. Lasse dazu 2 Bedrohungen entstehen, wenn dieser Mensch 2 oder weniger Lebenspunkte hat. <keyword>Sammeln:</keyword> Strenge einen <symbol>gondor</symbol> Menschen an und lege dieses Artefakt ab, um deine Handkarten abzulegen und 3 Karten zu ziehen.","""Glaubtest du, dass die Augen des Wei�en Turms blind seien?""","Seeing Stone of Minas Anor",,"To play, spot a <symbol>gondor</symbol> Man with 3 or more vitality (or spot a <symbol>gondor</symbol> Man and add 2 threats). <br><keyword>Regroup:</keyword> Exert a <symbol>gondor</symbol> Man or discard this artifact to discard your hand and draw 3 cards. ","��Didst thou think that the eyes of the White Tower were blind?'�","Seeing Stone of Minas Anor",,"To play, spot a <symbol>gondor</symbol> Man with 3 or more vitality (or spot a <symbol>gondor</symbol> Man and add 2 threats). <br><keyword>Regroup:</keyword> Exert a <symbol>gondor</symbol> Man or discard this artifact to discard your hand and draw 3 cards. ","��Didst thou think that the eyes of the White Tower were blind?'�","Seeing Stone of Minas Anor",,"To play, spot a <symbol>gondor</symbol> Man with 3 or more vitality (or spot a <symbol>gondor</symbol> Man and add 2 threats). <br><keyword>Regroup:</keyword> Exert a <symbol>gondor</symbol> Man or discard this artifact to discard your hand and draw 3 cards. ","��Didst thou think that the eyes of the White Tower were blind?'�"
