10000003,"63 68 89 09",10,"R",3,"10R3",0,"More Yet to Come",,"Dwarven","Event",,"Response",0,,,,,,,,"King Block","Dwarven_Verb","10_003",,,,,,,"If a Dwarf kills a minion in a skirmish and that minion did not take all wounds caused by that Dwarf's damage bonus, assign those remaining wounds to minions not assigned to a skirmish. ","��...whatever is still to do, I hope to have a part in it, for the honour of the folk of the Lonely Mountain.'�","Es wird noch einiges geschehen",,"Wenn ein Zwerg in einem Kampf einen Diener t�tet, und sein Schadensbonus gr��er ist, als die daf�r ben�tigten Wunden, f�ge die verbleibenden Wunden nicht zugewiesenen Dienern zu.","""Doch was immer noch zu tun ist, ich hoffe daran teilzuhaben, um der Ehre des Volks vom Einsamen Berg willen.""","More Yet to Come",,"If a Dwarf kills a minion in a skirmish and that minion did not take all wounds caused by that Dwarf's damage bonus, assign those remaining wounds to minions not assigned to a skirmish. ","��...whatever is still to do, I hope to have a part in it, for the honour of the folk of the Lonely Mountain.'�","More Yet to Come",,"If a Dwarf kills a minion in a skirmish and that minion did not take all wounds caused by that Dwarf's damage bonus, assign those remaining wounds to minions not assigned to a skirmish. ","��...whatever is still to do, I hope to have a part in it, for the honour of the folk of the Lonely Mountain.'�","More Yet to Come",,"If a Dwarf kills a minion in a skirmish and that minion did not take all wounds caused by that Dwarf's damage bonus, assign those remaining wounds to minions not assigned to a skirmish. ","��...whatever is still to do, I hope to have a part in it, for the honour of the folk of the Lonely Mountain.'�"
