10000009,"69 68 89 09",10,"R",9,"10R9",1,"Elrond","Venerable Lord","Elven","Companion","Elf",,4,8,4,,,,,,"King Block","Elven_Noun","10_009","icon_strength","8","icon_vitality","4",,,"To play, spot an Elf. <br>At the start of each skirmish involving Elrond, you may reveal the top card of your draw deck. If it is an <symbol>elven</symbol> card, you may heal another Elf. ","��To me then even our victory can bring only sorrow and parting � but to you hope of joy for a while.'�","Elrond","Ehrenwerter F�rst","Entdecke einen Elben, um Elrond zu spielen. <br>Zu Beginn jedes Kampfes, an dem Elrond beteiligt ist, darfst du die oberste Karte deines Spieldecks aufdecken. Handelt es sich dabei um eine <symbol>elven</symbol> Karte, darfst du einen anderen Elben heilen.","""Selbst unser Sieg kann mir... nur Kummer und Trennung bringen - aber dir die Hoffnung auf Gl�ck f�r eine Weile.""","Elrond","Venerable Lord","To play, spot an Elf. <br>At the start of each skirmish involving Elrond, you may reveal the top card of your draw deck. If it is an <symbol>elven</symbol> card, you may heal another Elf. ","��To me then even our victory can bring only sorrow and parting � but to you hope of joy for a while.'�","Elrond","Venerable Lord","To play, spot an Elf. <br>At the start of each skirmish involving Elrond, you may reveal the top card of your draw deck. If it is an <symbol>elven</symbol> card, you may heal another Elf. ","��To me then even our victory can bring only sorrow and parting � but to you hope of joy for a while.'�","Elrond","Venerable Lord","To play, spot an Elf. <br>At the start of each skirmish involving Elrond, you may reveal the top card of your draw deck. If it is an <symbol>elven</symbol> card, you may heal another Elf. ","��To me then even our victory can bring only sorrow and parting � but to you hope of joy for a while.'�"
