10000029,"6D 69 89 09",10,"R",29,"10R29",0,"Drawing His Eye",,"Gondor","Event",,"Fellowship",2,,,,,,,,"King Block","Gondor_Verb","10_029",,,,,,,"For each <symbol>gondor</symbol> companion you spot, reveal 1 card at random from a Shadow player's hand. Choose a revealed Shadow card to be discarded, then its owner draws a card. ","��We cannot achieve victory by arms, but by arms we can give the Ring-bearer his only chance, frail though it be.'�","Seinen Blick abwenden",,"Decke f�r jeden <symbol>gondor</symbol> Gef�hrten, den du entdeckst, 1 zuf�llig bestimmte Karte aus der Hand eines Schattenspielers auf. W�hle eine der aufgedeckten Schattenkarten aus, die abgelegt werden muss. Ihr Besitzer zieht dann eine Karte.","""... aber mit Waffen k�nnen wir dem Ringtr�ger die einzige Unterst�tzung bieten, wie gering die Aussichten auch sein m�gen.""","Drawing His Eye",,"For each <symbol>gondor</symbol> companion you spot, reveal 1 card at random from a Shadow player's hand. Choose a revealed Shadow card to be discarded, then its owner draws a card. ","��We cannot achieve victory by arms, but by arms we can give the Ring-bearer his only chance, frail though it be.'�","Drawing His Eye",,"For each <symbol>gondor</symbol> companion you spot, reveal 1 card at random from a Shadow player's hand. Choose a revealed Shadow card to be discarded, then its owner draws a card. ","��We cannot achieve victory by arms, but by arms we can give the Ring-bearer his only chance, frail though it be.'�","Drawing His Eye",,"For each <symbol>gondor</symbol> companion you spot, reveal 1 card at random from a Shadow player's hand. Choose a revealed Shadow card to be discarded, then its owner draws a card. ","��We cannot achieve victory by arms, but by arms we can give the Ring-bearer his only chance, frail though it be.'�"
