11000021,"65 8D 7D 0A",11,"S",21,"11S21",1,"Legolas","Companion of the Ring","Elven","Companion","Elf",,2,6,3,7,,,,,"War of the Ring Block","Elven_Noun","11_021","icon_strength","6","icon_vitality","3","Icon_Resistance","7","While Legolas is at a battleground or forest site, he is strength +2 and resistance +2.","��I am one of the Nine Companions who set out with Mithrandir from Imladris... and with this Dwarf, my friend, I came with the Lord Aragorn.'�","Legolas","Gef�hrte des Rings","Solange sich Legolas an einem Schlachtfeld oder Wald befindet, erh�lt er St�rke +2 und Resistenz +2.","""Ich bin einer der Neun Gef�hrten, die mit Mithrandir von Imladris aufbrachen ... und mit diesem Zwergen, meinem Freund, kam ich mit dem Herrn Aragorn.�","Legolas","Companion of the Ring","While Legolas is at a battleground or forest site, he is strength +2 and resistance +2.","��I am one of the Nine Companions who set out with Mithrandir from Imladris... and with this Dwarf, my friend, I came with the Lord Aragorn.'�","Legolas","Companion of the Ring","While Legolas is at a battleground or forest site, he is strength +2 and resistance +2.","��I am one of the Nine Companions who set out with Mithrandir from Imladris... and with this Dwarf, my friend, I came with the Lord Aragorn.'�","Legolas","Companion of the Ring","While Legolas is at a battleground or forest site, he is strength +2 and resistance +2.","��I am one of the Nine Companions who set out with Mithrandir from Imladris... and with this Dwarf, my friend, I came with the Lord Aragorn.'�"
