11000023,"67 8D 7D 0A",11,"R",23,"11R23",1,"Legolas' Bow",,"Elven","Possession",,"Ranged Weapon",2,,,,,,,,"War of the Ring Block","Elven_Verb","11_023",,,,,,,"Bearer must be an Elf. <br>Bearer is an <keyword>Archer.</keyword> If bearer is Legolas, each time you exert him to play an <symbol>elven</symbol> condition or <symbol>elven</symbol> event, you may heal him (limit once per phase).","Though not as sturdy as the bows of the Galadhrim, a Mirkwood bow is no less dangerous in skilled hands.","Legolas' Bogen",,"Muss auf einen Elben gespielt werden. Der Tr�ger ist <keyword>Bogensch�tze</keyword>. Wenn Legolas mit dieser Karte ausger�stet ist, darfst du ihn jedes Mal heilen, wenn du ihn anstrengst, um einen <symbol>elven</symbol> Effekt oder ein <symbol>elven</symbol> Ereignis zu spielen (max. 1 pro Phase).","Obwohl nicht so stabil wie die B�gen der Galadhrim, sind die B�gen aus D�sterwald in ge�bten H�nden nicht weniger t�dlich.","Legolas' Bow",,"Bearer must be an Elf. <br>Bearer is an <keyword>Archer.</keyword> If bearer is Legolas, each time you exert him to play an <symbol>elven</symbol> condition or <symbol>elven</symbol> event, you may heal him (limit once per phase).","Though not as sturdy as the bows of the Galadhrim, a Mirkwood bow is no less dangerous in skilled hands.","Legolas' Bow",,"Bearer must be an Elf. <br>Bearer is an <keyword>Archer.</keyword> If bearer is Legolas, each time you exert him to play an <symbol>elven</symbol> condition or <symbol>elven</symbol> event, you may heal him (limit once per phase).","Though not as sturdy as the bows of the Galadhrim, a Mirkwood bow is no less dangerous in skilled hands.","Legolas' Bow",,"Bearer must be an Elf. <br>Bearer is an <keyword>Archer.</keyword> If bearer is Legolas, each time you exert him to play an <symbol>elven</symbol> condition or <symbol>elven</symbol> event, you may heal him (limit once per phase).","Though not as sturdy as the bows of the Galadhrim, a Mirkwood bow is no less dangerous in skill