11000024,"68 8D 7D 0A",11,"R",24,"11R24",0,"Might of the Elf-lords",,"Elven","Event",,"Skirmish",1,,,,,,,,"War of the Ring Block","Elven_Verb","11_024",,,,,,,"Exert an Elf to reveal the top card of your draw deck. If that card's  twilight cost is 3 or less, make a minion strength �3. ","�Dimly Frodo saw the river below him rise, and down along its course there came a plumed cavalry of waves.�","Macht der Elbenf�rsten",,"Strenge einen Elben an, um die oberste Karte deines Spieldecks aufzudecken. Wenn die Zwielichtkosten dieser Karte 3 oder weniger betragen, gib einem Diener St�rke -3.","""Undeutlich sah Frodo, wie der Fluss unter ihm stieg und eine ganze Reiterschar von Wellen das Flussbett herunterkam.�","Might of the Elf-lords",,"Exert an Elf to reveal the top card of your draw deck. If that card's  twilight cost is 3 or less, make a minion strength �3. ","�Dimly Frodo saw the river below him rise, and down along its course there came a plumed cavalry of waves.�","Might of the Elf-lords",,"Exert an Elf to reveal the top card of your draw deck. If that card's  twilight cost is 3 or less, make a minion strength �3. ","�Dimly Frodo saw the river below him rise, and down along its course there came a plumed cavalry of waves.�","Might of the Elf-lords",,"Exert an Elf to reveal the top card of your draw deck. If that card's  twilight cost is 3 or less, make a minion strength �3. ","�Dimly Frodo saw the river below him rise, and down along its course there came a plumed cavalry of waves.�"
