11000026,"6A 8D 7D 0A",11,"U",26,"11U26",1,"Uncertain Future",,"Elven","Condition",,"Support Area",1,,,,,,,,"War of the Ring Block","Elven_Verb","11_026",,,,,,,"When you play this condition, spot an Elf to add 3 <symbol>elven</symbol> tokens here. <keyword>Maneuver:</keyword> Discard this condition or remove an <symbol>elven</symbol> token from here to reveal the top card of your draw deck. You may place that card beneath your draw deck. ","��What did you see?'�","Unsichere Zukunft",,"Wenn du diesen Effekt spielst, entdecke einen Elben, um 3 <symbol>elven</symbol> Marken auf diese Karte zu legen. <keyword>Man�ver:</keyword> Lege diese Karte ab oder entferne eine <symbol>elven</symbol> Marke von dieser Karte, um die oberste Karte deines Spieldecks aufzudecken. Du darfst diese Karte unter dein Spie ldeck legen.","""Was hast du gesehen?�","Uncertain Future",,"When you play this condition, spot an Elf to add 3 <symbol>elven</symbol> tokens here. <keyword>Maneuver:</keyword> Discard this condition or remove an <symbol>elven</symbol> token from here to reveal the top card of your draw deck. You may place that card beneath your draw deck. ","��What did you see?'�","Uncertain Future",,"When you play this condition, spot an Elf to add 3 <symbol>elven</symbol> tokens here. <keyword>Maneuver:</keyword> Discard this condition or remove an <symbol>elven</symbol> token from here to reveal the top card of your draw deck. You may place that card beneath your draw deck. ","��What did you see?'�","Uncertain Future",,"When you play this condition, spot an Elf to add 3 <symbol>elven</symbol> tokens here. <keyword>Maneuver:</keyword> Discard this condition or remove an <symbol>elven</symbol> token from here to reveal the top card of your draw deck. You may place that card beneath your draw deck. ","��What did you see?'�"
